<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The ADSs are expected to be delivered through the book-entry transfer
facilities of The Depository Trust Company in New York, New York, and the Series A Warrants are expected to be delivered against payment
therefor, on or about November 13, 2025. The Placement Agent Warrants are expected to be delivered against payment therefore, on or about
November 13, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 14pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Maxim Group LLC</B></P>

