<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The outstanding share information in the table
above is based on 1,069,058,200 Class A ordinary shares and 360,302,950 shares of Class B ordinary shares issued and outstanding as of
June 30, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The following table summarizes, on an as pro forma adjusted basis as of June 30, 2025 to give effect to the issuance of 7,874,015 ADSs,
