<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">our&#8239;goals and growth strategies, and our ability to implement such
strategies;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

